Fixes #864

`Planner` moved to `sync::plan` in the engine split but `crates/widget-cli/src/cmd/push.rs` still imported the old path. One-line fix, plus a CI step that builds all workspace crates (the split PR only built `widget-core`, which is why it went green).

```diff
-use crate::sync::engine::Planner;
+use crate::sync::plan::Planner;
```
